/**
@page features Features

Telematics SDK provides APIs for the following features:

@section call_management Call Management
  - Control Operations
    - Originate 
    - Receive  
    - Hold
    - Hangup
  - In call (Multi-party) / Conference, Swap
  - Emergency Call (eCall 112)
  - Call state notifications

@section sms SMS
  - Send, Receive operations
  - Support for GSM7, GSM8, UCS2 SMS messages

@section sim_toolkit_services SIM Card Services
  - Get Supported Card applications
  - APDU Operations
    - Open, Close channel
    - Send, Receive data
  - SAP Operations
    - Open, Close
    - SIM Power On/Off/Reset
    - Send SAP APDU
    - Get Card Reader Status

@section device_management Phone Management
  - Phone static information
    - Device Identifiers
  - Servicing System information
    - Signal strength

*/
